stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RECEIVED

    RECEIVED --> RECEIVED : assignMechanic
    RECEIVED --> IN_DIAGNOSIS : startDiagnosis
    RECEIVED --> WAITING_APPROVAL : requestApproval

    IN_DIAGNOSIS --> IN_DIAGNOSIS : startDiagnosis<br/>(reabrir)
    IN_DIAGNOSIS --> WAITING_APPROVAL : requestApproval<br/>(criar orçamento)

    WAITING_APPROVAL --> IN_EXECUTION : startService<br/>(aprovar orçamento)
    WAITING_APPROVAL --> IN_DIAGNOSIS : rejectEstimate<br/>(retorna diagnóstico)

    IN_EXECUTION --> FINISHED : finish<br/>(mecânico atribuído)

    FINISHED --> DELIVERED : deliverVehicle

    DELIVERED --> CLOSED : close

    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of RECEIVED
        OS recém-criada,
        aguardando triagem
    end note

    note right of WAITING_APPROVAL
        Orçamento gerado,
        aguardando aprovação
        do cliente
    end note

    note right of IN_EXECUTION
        Serviço em andamento,
        apenas o mecânico
        atribuído pode finalizar
    end note
